                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a great little retro style action platformer with colorful, big juicy pixel graphics and awesome chip tune music.\nTotal play time to beat it was about an hour and 2 minute or so for me. Sir Noggin is fun but not overly challenging, only two boss fights gave me some challenge but that's okay, I wanted something a bit lighter to play through and this is exactly what I was looking for.\n\nVideo Review:\nhttps://youtu.be/0snaz5d-j5A\n\nI would recommend this game but it isn't mandatory that you play it, but if you do you will likely enjoy the time you have with it.",
